  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ\r\nおはよう、夏葉──って",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "0000"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110070,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "alpha": 1,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……今日、少し雰囲気が違うか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002",
    "bgm": "006"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110080,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "あら",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110090,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ\r\n気付いてくれるなんて嬉しいわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110090"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110100,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "いつもとメイクが違うのよ\r\nこの間の新作を使ってみたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりそうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "この間も思ったけど──\r\nそういう感じも、似合ってる",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110110,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ありがとう",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110120,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……イベントの時は、メイクさんがついてくれて\r\nそういうふうに仕上げてもらったから",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110130,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "自分でもできているなら、よかったわ",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110140,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "私は、一番このアイテムの魅力を\r\n届けられる人間でいなきゃいけないもの",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、そうだな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──きっとそういう夏葉だから、\r\n商品の良さを最大限引き出せるし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうやって使われた商品だから、\r\n夏葉の魅力をさらに高めてくれるんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110150,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は、そう思うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110160,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "うふふ\r\n朝から褒め殺しね、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110170,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "でも、それは当たり前のことね\r\n私も、このアイテムも、それが仕事なんだから",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110180,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110190,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "──でも……\r\n嬉しいのも間違いないわ",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110200,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "当たり前のことでも、自分が気を付けていることを\r\n認めてもらえたら自信になる",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110210,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "今日はメイクを変えることで\r\n気持ちを入れ直してみたつもりだったけれど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110220,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "……アナタの言葉には勝てないわね",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110230,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "さすがは、有栖川夏葉のプロデューサー\r\nといったところかしら",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110230"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは……！\r\nそれこそ、当たり前で、嬉しい言葉だな……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 2000
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……──よし\r\nそれじゃあ今日の仕事も、いつも通り全力で臨もう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2013011110240,
    "speaker": "夏葉",
    "text": "ええ、もちろんよ！\r\n車を出してちょうだい、プロデューサー",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "natsuha",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/201301111/2013011110240"
  },
  {
